{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_005_1000_p", "source_sha256": "047c21207c2425d3beba4e4ec311d6af88060f362daccff86efc05f2907e7678", "ja": "（劇場の定期公演が終わった。\n今回は、ロコも出演していたのだけれど……）", "zh": "（剧场的定期公演结束了。这次，ROCO也参加了演出，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_005_1001_025roc", "source_sha256": "949df1cd1df347f84c40a0cd2af5d0320b9aea985883ee923fc96ad9f58832fa", "ja": "ううっ……。ロコは……ロコはどうして、\nあんなミスを……。", "zh": "呜呜……。ROCO到底……ROCO到底为什么，\n会犯那种失误……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_005_1002_p", "source_sha256": "dc40565bf0a005bbb5aa8a58ea004f71197ed08a57f989161225f6301464af9d", "ja": "ロコ……そんなに気を落とさなくても大丈夫だよ。\n失敗したとはいえ、最後までよく頑張ったな！", "zh": "ROCO……不用这么灰心。虽然失败了，但你还是努力坚持到了最后！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_005_1003_025roc", "source_sha256": "72f90d3fbe766c4373247262db34b43c93909983d94ad0e759e3db244ff9c3ba", "ja": "{$P$}……。\n今日のステージ、ロコはベリーバッドでした……。", "zh": "{$P$}……。\n今天的舞台，ROCO非常糟糕……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_005_1004_025roc", "source_sha256": "c51d7c9d76f29df93666bbb2638b7a1a7ac985e8701e6e3fa68fb5f79309870e", "ja": "ファーストステップからミスをしましたし、\nそれで焦って、トークプランも忘れました……。", "zh": "从第一步就失误了，\n还因此慌了神，连谈话计划也忘了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_005_1005_p", "source_sha256": "5454a4c05a66fefdd26e6a55c867de1fe3967f379b85c63f78c4aee04359cf50", "ja": "そんなに落ち込まなくても……\n歩のカバーで、ダンスは問題なく進んだし。", "zh": "不用这么消沉……\n有步帮忙顶上，舞蹈环节也顺利进行下去了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_005_1006_p", "source_sha256": "a1b07f6e241c1bcef20428be0904e8b540858fa023fc9a84e51a777dc9671646", "ja": "それにMCも、千鶴さんのフォローで\n逆に盛り上がってたじゃないか。", "zh": "而且MC环节在千鹤小姐的帮忙下，反而变得更热闹了不是吗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_005_1007_025roc", "source_sha256": "02a7a33d767465adfdd861bf2a3ff535a8493d61c5be37eb79f15f3dba2c2daf", "ja": "でも、でも……ううっ。こんなの、\nこんなのアーティスティックじゃありません～！", "zh": "但是，但是……呜呜。这样、这样一点都不艺术～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_005_1008_025roc", "source_sha256": "1cd891c0753e446898ecbd843047a5d45bfb04fc029b23a89b5d00fc328c73b7", "ja": "リカバリーできたのは、歌だけで……。\nこのままじゃロコは……ロコは……。", "zh": "能恢复的只有歌曲……这样下去，ROCO会……ROCO会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_005_1009_p", "source_sha256": "8b2c59d3b61efb3391842036ba4a832aba8a5ae5df7e6ee3753829df30e397fa", "ja": "（うーん、すっかり後ろ向きになってしまった。\nなんとかロコを元気づけないと……）", "zh": "（嗯——完全变得消极起来了。得想办法让ROCO打起精神来才行……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_005_1010_p", "source_sha256": "f8d21053c0a02887578f034330d1093892ddbe2ef32fd01ea0a8c46647e97a4f", "ja": "なあ、ロコ。ロコはこれから、\nどんなアイドルになりたいと思ってる？", "zh": "喂，ROCO。ROCO今后想成为怎样的偶像？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_005_1011_025roc", "source_sha256": "63b8ae74053c492c0d31c151a62776510c58a363d03c5bcf4d8e3e02bf2a328e", "ja": "え？　……ええと、\nそれはいつも言ってるとおり……。", "zh": "诶？……那个，\n就像我一直说的那样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_005_1012_025roc", "source_sha256": "c9bc9ff15e5fe9a29d43cb19d9f7ea3134684903446cbdc17e3fac17fd863180", "ja": "ロコはニュージェネレーションのインスタレーションを\nアイドルという形でアクチュアライズしたいんです。", "zh": "ROCO想以偶像的形式，将新世代的装置具体呈现出来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_005_1013_p", "source_sha256": "a4c6b8a43996c8b63979ddb1f80b5191ff9a9661412313a7e304fce713c1500f", "ja": "なるほど、確かにいつもどおりだな。\n……けどそれって、具体的にどんなアイドルなんだ？", "zh": "原来如此，确实一如既往啊。\n……不过，具体来说，那究竟是怎样的偶像？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_005_1014_025roc", "source_sha256": "32750c4f2f356d1e1d13203a0214b890e0a1a34d589c8d36ab428ed07f26cb44", "ja": "ぐ、具体的にですか？\nそれはですね……ええと……ええと……。", "zh": "具、具体地说吗？\n那个呢……呃……呃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_005_1015_025roc", "source_sha256": "7e70dfee7f5947d1b5a6fff04785727deac6103adae019840ba3738207bfeee6", "ja": "うぅ……、{$P$}。\nそれは、ロコにもわからないんです……。", "zh": "呜……，{$P$}。\n那个，连ROCO自己也搞不清楚……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_005_1016_025roc", "source_sha256": "28dfc1f6b5c0533fb58d7d6d4b263d0830f198f326805fbde64798c303d6cc52", "ja": "ロコは今まで、グラフィックでもスタチューでも、\n自分のビジョンを、自分の手で作ってきました。", "zh": "到目前为止，ROCO无论是平面作品还是雕像，都是用自己的双手创造出自己的构想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_005_1017_025roc", "source_sha256": "d4e7017f3e2a17052ee9600e5f23b21c91c545d163cf7180b038b98305dee651", "ja": "けど……アイドルというアートは、\n全然、ロコの思ったとおりになってくれません……。", "zh": "但是……偶像这种艺术，完全不会按照ROCO所想的那样发展……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_005_1018_p", "source_sha256": "fd2f8f7e38e23340919ba1cd938ad1da93e08339cc10952838640e8b29035bc9", "ja": "ロコ……。", "zh": "ROCO……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_005_1019_025roc", "source_sha256": "bf6fe0dd605a281bec1b9b619ede2873aefcd3a8297fbfc58c11a543e054cf56", "ja": "ロコは、運動はそんなに得意じゃないですし。\nダンスもフォーメーションも、うまくできなくて……。", "zh": "ROCO不太擅长运动。\n舞蹈和队形也做得不好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_005_1020_025roc", "source_sha256": "6a6398525e1328740530d5ac2fa1bd6689fdae7783a80674cfa59179e6077fdf", "ja": "でも、でも……\nロコは、あきらめたくないの！", "zh": "可是，可是……ROCO，我不想放弃！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_005_1021_025roc", "source_sha256": "751109e9d15b54093222212e55993cde54369b5332213afdb95c94cc30398735", "ja": "ロコがエクスプレッションしたいアートは、\nやっぱり、アイドル活動の中にあるって思うから……！", "zh": "因为我果然还是觉得，ROCO想要表达的艺术，就在偶像活动之中……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_005_1022_p", "source_sha256": "5c1abc9bf505b8239b8cce2c28bdd16ed53226f7888a0f099be4556f14f5638e", "ja": "（ロコは、理想と現実のギャップに苦しんでいる。\nアイドルならきっと、誰もが持つ悩みだけど……）", "zh": "（ROCO正因理想与现实的差距而苦恼。只要是偶像，想必谁都有这样的烦恼吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_005_1023_025roc", "source_sha256": "511307ec707d4fa36a9dee863235bf8870ce82d9fa16d56a924df5391c41541b", "ja": "ロコの頭の中では、もっとパーフェクトで\nエクセレントなステージがイメージできてるんです！", "zh": "在ROCO的脑海里，能够想象出更加完美、更加出色的舞台！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_005_1024_025roc", "source_sha256": "9646db6833ab9e4ff402b5b3cb18696e68957ea98e8d1808848f781891f16097", "ja": "でもリアルでは、うまく\nエクスプレッションできなくて……ううっ。", "zh": "可是到了现实中，却没办法很好地表现出来……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_005_1025_p", "source_sha256": "8d7e3b3911a5847f047b2b544103fc052e018cdcf264988f2e9426106136bc14", "ja": "そうか。……理想と現実のギャップに\n自分で気がつけるなんて、ロコはすごいな！", "zh": "这样啊。……能自己察觉到理想与现实之间的差距，ROCO真厉害！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_005_1026_025roc", "source_sha256": "4cc00ca0d5f6248c18ffee646e881a82f94f80eb0420a9688150f6e077f4a4e9", "ja": "えっ……{$P$}？", "zh": "咦……{$P$}？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_005_1027_p", "source_sha256": "7e838b68ea4462e0b6a21555d6bc6ce73b7004620cf3142f2fae0713ccf62f9b", "ja": "理想の自分と、今の自分の実力がわかったんだ。\nなら、足りないところを埋めていく努力をすればいい。", "zh": "我明白了理想中的自己和现在自己的实力。\n既然如此，只要努力弥补不足之处就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_005_1028_p", "source_sha256": "a8d790f2ae51ac173083115c37131079966953a5e6293154fcce4d4b95b0c2a9", "ja": "早速、今から作戦会議をしようか。\n1日も早く、ロコの理想のステージに近づくためにな！", "zh": "那就从现在开始开个作战会议吧。为了早1天接近ROCO理想的舞台！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_005_1029_025roc", "source_sha256": "4aa7ff57eb56bce3136c46cdc1fd67f94aece752859bd0a0e7d9e6840d34a2ce", "ja": "{$P$}……{$P$}は\nやっぱり、ロコズパートナーです～！", "zh": "{$P$}……{$P$}果然是ROCO搭档～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_005_1030_025roc", "source_sha256": "d1f8f1f42f4c13fe7338c957e95e22f4b5f1da198658d45cd44827fb97787703", "ja": "オフコースですよ！\nすぐに、アジェンダをまとめますね！", "zh": "当然可以！\n我马上整理议程！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_005_1031_025roc", "source_sha256": "02b8363c06b12fa500caba49fdf8a892e4fb50c9da4cb099198a934ead68d119", "ja": "ロコが理想のアイドルをアクチュアライズできるように\nナビゲーション、どうかよろしくお願いしますね！", "zh": "为了让ROCO能够实现理想中的偶像，\n导航就拜托您了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_025roc_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_025roc_005_1032_p", "source_sha256": "9b02129a9adaefb392e5923825fe3f297d01567658d6144e5a59ee569cb9eb3c", "ja": "（進むべき方向さえ見つけられれば、ロコはどこまでも\n努力できるはずだ。さあ、ミーティングを始めよう！）", "zh": "（只要找到前进的方向，ROCO应该就能不断努力。好了，开始开会吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
